Gravelbeard, the Battle-hardened Dwarf</font><br /><br />
<img src="http://www.mokb.org/cgi-bin/SS/SS1577.jpg"><br />
<font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="-2" color="#3333FF">
Gravelbeard, the Disco Dwarf</font>
</td>
<td>
<font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333">
<h3>Gravelbeard's Inaugural Outtakes</h3>
<p>
<br>
<a href="http://veepers.budlight.com/service/RetrieveCard?id=vgAd66UV2bglDRJBtv.Cqq" target="_blank">Speech - Take 1</a>
<br />
<br>
