<font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333">
<p>
<p>
For some strange reason someone could not figure out if this was the MoKB web site. Well, we thought we would try some reverse psychology. Anyway, it was time for a short update. 
<p>
We have been extremely busy over the last month. Part of the time was spent working internally in the guild. The other part was spent dealing with problems caused from outside the guild. We have had new officers step up and have have a lot of volunteers for the committees. We have also had a number of good recruits join. Some are new to the guild and some are old members that have come back. We have had a lot of support to help us through the events of last month. We especially want to thank many of the former MoKB members from last year. Your words of encouragement and offers of support were greatly appreciated.
<p>
We are now back on our feet. We still have challenges ahead but we are now ready to proceed. We have met many new friends over the last few weeks and have begun raiding our old stomping grounds. This week, we started with Behemoth and Terris Thule. Flawless. We will be increasing our raids and variety of targets over the coming weeks. Again, we want to thank everyone for their support.
<p>
<p>
